"only one of them, and which one is undefined: the records of the other are "
"ignored, or served by another DC. Compare both copies, keep the one in "
"DomainDnsZones or ForestDnsZones, and delete the other by hand."
msgstr ""

#: rust/annuaire-app/src/health_views.rs
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"The last record of {nom} was removed on {date}; the object stays in the "
"directory, marked as deleted. Windows purges it after {seuil} days; Samba "
